  // ─── Parse AI-detected schedule, if any ──────────────────────────────
  // 2026-05-19 v3: split on milestone-BOUNDARY lookahead instead of on
  // every comma / "and". Pre-fix, text like:
  //   "50% upon delivery, acceptance, and signoff by both parties"
  // was split into 4 fragments by `,` and ` and `, dropping everything
  // after the first comma from the milestone's prose. Now we split
  // only at points that LOOK like a new milestone starts — a fresh
  // "<N>%" or "$<N>" token (optionally preceded by ";"). The prose
  // inside one milestone (commas, "and", etc.) is preserved verbatim.
