  // them continue anyway (soft gate, not a hard block). A step that doesn't
  // apply to the template (no logic defs / no placeholders) is never required.
  // Admin-pushable so the requirement is enforced fleet-wide; flip OFF to
  // disable the warning entirely (kill switch).
